01:02:39.480 --> 01:02:41.914
and want to look for you immediately


01:03:45.520 --> 01:03:46.316
Fei-er


01:03:46.560 --> 01:03:48.391
Be careful. You will catch cold


01:05:37.600 --> 01:05:38.350
General


01:05:39.760 --> 01:05:40.875
I just received news


01:05:41.080 --> 01:05:43.674
The tyrant Hu Ba secretly lead some troops out of the city


01:05:43.960 --> 01:05:45.313
It's treason


01:05:48.640 --> 01:05:49.960
Does he want to besiege the city and rebel?


01:05:49.960 --> 01:05:54.750
Civil war at this time, Yan Guo cannot become a nation


01:05:55.840 --> 01:05:59.310
Princess had just abdicated
We must certainly stand firm in this situation


01:06:35.600 --> 01:06:36.316
You see


01:06:36.360 --> 01:06:37.156
I just found one


01:06:37.800 --> 01:06:39.233
The purple ganoderma lucidum is good for health and vitality


01:06:39.440 --> 01:06:41.158
In this mountain, there is plenty


01:06:41.360 --> 01:06:43.635
Let's dig seperately and see who got the most?


01:06:43.800 --> 01:06:46.840
Mmm I shall go that side


01:06:46.840 --> 01:06:48.478
Good


01:07:07.280 --> 01:07:10.158
A guest from faraway, forgive me for not receiving


01:07:10.200 --> 01:07:13.078
You have buried this knife
But could not bury your past


01:07:15.480 --> 01:07:16.799
Shuo Yue Warrior


01:07:17.040 --> 01:07:18.951
I only an average person who lives here


01:07:19.160 --> 01:07:20.070
Let's get on with it


01:07:20.280 --> 01:07:21.190
Why must you compel me?


01:07:21.600 --> 01:07:22.874
If you do not have the courage to draw your sword today


01:07:23.080 --> 01:07:25.310
it is the equal to have no qualification to be with Fei-er


01:08:07.840 --> 01:08:09.558
I did not want to use the knife again


01:08:09.840 --> 01:08:11.114
What is your purpose in coming here?


01:08:11.400 --> 01:08:14.278
The weapon in the hand of a man
is not used for killing


01:08:14.480 --> 01:08:17.358
But is used for protecting the most important things in our life



01:08:17.400 --> 01:08:18.958
Yan Guo is no longer a safe place


01:08:19.160 --> 01:08:23.233
You bring Fei-er and get away from here
The further the better


01:08:25.000 --> 01:08:26.194
Thanks


01:08:40.160 --> 01:08:42.594
Qucik! Quick!


01:08:42.640 --> 01:08:43.789
Surround them


01:08:44.040 --> 01:08:44.790
Surround them


01:08:56.920 --> 01:08:58.751
All of you want to revolt?


01:09:32.040 --> 01:09:33.792
Teng Bochang's fate will be like yours


01:09:40.560 --> 01:09:43.120
I will tear you into shreds


01:09:43.160 --> 01:09:44.593
You can come here and try


01:09:56.960 --> 01:09:59.679
General don't come and pester here
It is a trap


01:10:00.320 --> 01:10:01.639
Kill them all!


01:10:04.640 --> 01:10:05.789
Let's all kill our way out


01:10:05.840 --> 01:10:07.512
Jigong's brothers
Is waiting for us outside the city


01:10:07.840 --> 01:10:09.558
General take the Fei Ren sword and go
Quickly , go!


01:10:10.480 --> 01:10:11.595
Archer


01:10:11.640 --> 01:10:12.789
Shoot


01:10:12.840 --> 01:10:13.875
Retreat!


01:10:13.920 --> 01:10:14.830
Go!


01:10:19.160 --> 01:10:20.957
General, go quickly.


01:10:21.440 --> 01:10:22.555
Closes the city gate


01:10:23.400 --> 01:10:24.150
Quick


01:10:25.120 --> 01:10:26.758
What are you doing?


01:10:26.800 --> 01:10:30.270
Open the gate! Open the gate!


01:10:31.720 --> 01:10:32.630
What are you doing?


01:10:35.240 --> 01:10:36.195
General! Leave quickly!


01:10:36.240 --> 01:10:37.036
If we want to leave, we leave together!


01:10:39.320 --> 01:10:40.878
Open the gate, let me in


01:10:40.920 --> 01:10:43.195
With Fei Yan Ren sword in your hand
go and summom the troops


01:10:45.720 --> 01:10:46.755
General leave quickly


01:10:48.680 --> 01:10:51.831
General won't abandon all of you
if we must die, we die together


01:10:51.880 --> 01:10:58.638
General, don't let us die in vain


01:11:27.880 --> 01:11:28.835
Fei-er


01:11:31.320 --> 01:11:34.471
There is something I want to tell you


01:11:37.240 --> 01:11:39.276
If you don't say, I already knew


01:11:40.400 --> 01:11:42.914
Shuo Yue's warriors and Yan Guo's grudges in the past


01:11:42.960 --> 01:11:44.473
It's already in the past


01:11:45.760 --> 01:11:49.355
What I care about is our future


01:11:52.400 --> 01:11:55.119
General Murong has looked me up today


01:11:55.680 --> 01:11:56.954
Ah Hu brother came?


01:11:58.040 --> 01:11:59.598
He wants me to take you away


01:12:00.040 --> 01:12:03.589
I think probably something have happened in Yan Guo


01:12:13.440 --> 01:12:15.954
I thought I can make my dream into reality


01:12:18.800 --> 01:12:21.519
Why don't you conceal it from me?


01:12:24.960 --> 01:12:30.239
I rather hate myself then you hating me


01:12:32.480 --> 01:12:35.597
For you, I can give up the throne


01:12:35.640 --> 01:12:39.428
But I cannot let the people of Yan Guo
Live in suffering and pain


01:12:40.920 --> 01:12:44.879
Lanquan wait for me to come back


01:13:41.720 --> 01:13:42.630
Eh


01:15:35.640 --> 01:15:36.550
How is your wound?


01:15:36.960 --> 01:15:37.676
Don't worry


01:15:38.640 --> 01:15:40.631
You forgot


01:15:40.680 --> 01:15:43.148
Previously I have used three days
to cure you of your poison


01:15:43.200 --> 01:15:44.155
Do not worry about me


01:15:44.440 --> 01:15:47.079
Hury up and go to Yan Guo
General Murong is waiting for you


01:15:48.280 --> 01:15:49.076
Quick


01:15:49.520 --> 01:15:50.157
Wait for me to come back


01:15:53.600 --> 01:15:54.669
I will wait


01:16:26.600 --> 01:16:27.680
General General


01:16:27.680 --> 01:16:29.955
General is back! General is back!


01:16:30.320 --> 01:16:31.355
General general


01:16:31.400 --> 01:16:43.392
General is back


01:16:47.440 --> 01:16:48.555
Are all of you that is left?


01:16:49.600 --> 01:16:50.430
Where are the others?


01:16:51.680 --> 01:16:52.795
The military compound was burnt


01:16:53.280 --> 01:16:57.114
All our brothers are dead


01:16:59.000 --> 01:17:03.073
They sacrificed themselves in order to save me


01:17:10.200 --> 01:17:11.428
All of you leave


01:17:12.400 --> 01:17:16.871
From now on,
I am no more your general 


01:17:17.360 --> 01:17:18.236
Go!


01:17:54.320 --> 01:17:57.392
Are you courting death? Or to surrender?


01:18:07.080 --> 01:18:11.710
Don't you want my head?
If you got the guts, come and take it!


01:18:11.760 --> 01:18:16.231
This tactic is not effective on me.
Bring his head to me


01:18:17.440 --> 01:18:24.152
Kill!


01:20:33.200 --> 01:20:35.953
Murong Shie Hu


01:20:36.720 --> 01:20:38.392
I want you to die here, today


01:20:38.680 --> 01:20:39.510
Come!


01:20:54.600 --> 01:20:57.637
Let me see how long your blood will flow!


01:21:07.520 --> 01:21:09.033
Who else dares!!?


01:22:27.680 --> 01:22:30.638
Stop! Everybody stop!


01:22:32.200 --> 01:22:33.997
AH Hu brother! Ah Hu brother!


01:22:35.240 --> 01:22:36.150
Qucikly go!


01:22:36.200 --> 01:22:37.519
You are only courting death


01:22:37.880 --> 01:22:43.113
The warrior can die but can never be defeated!


01:22:45.160 --> 01:22:46.195
Murong Shie Hu


01:22:46.640 --> 01:22:48.835
If you got the guts, stand up


01:22:49.240 --> 01:22:50.719
Hu Ba


01:22:52.360 --> 01:22:56.433
because of one man's ambition
so many had to die


01:22:56.640 --> 01:22:59.074
You are the one who should die!


01:22:59.120 --> 01:23:00.553
If you have the ability, come here and kill me


01:23:00.840 --> 01:23:03.434
Today, I will make a stand with you


01:23:03.480 --> 01:23:04.993
Fei-er! Fei-er!
You are not his match


01:23:06.280 --> 01:23:09.875
What?
Don't even dare to avenge your father?


01:23:10.320 --> 01:23:12.675
The king was killed by you!!! You beast!


01:23:14.880 --> 01:23:15.710
Ah Hu brother


01:23:16.960 --> 01:23:19.633
I will kill Hu Ba for the sake of Yan Guo


01:23:19.880 --> 01:23:22.235
Even if I have to die


01:23:22.280 --> 01:23:23.269
Good


01:23:36.920 --> 01:23:38.273
Come


01:24:26.760 --> 01:24:30.309
I will use your blood to offer as a sacrifice for my new dynasty


01:24:30.920 --> 01:24:31.955
Fei-er


01:25:03.520 --> 01:25:05.431
Ah Hu brother


01:25:38.840 --> 01:25:40.159
Lanquan


01:26:01.520 --> 01:26:04.114
You said that you will wait for me to come back


01:26:05.360 --> 01:26:07.510
I came back


01:26:16.840 --> 01:26:19.832
Together we will look at the highest mountain


01:26:21.480 --> 01:26:24.153
The biggest sea


01:26:26.760 --> 01:26:28.398
Lanquan


01:26:29.840 --> 01:26:31.671
You get up


01:26:32.720 --> 01:26:35.712
Bring me away


01:26:49.800 --> 01:26:51.199
Lanquan


01:26:51.800 --> 01:26:56.920
The world's most beautiful thing
Is the time I spent with you


01:26:57.320 --> 01:27:03.475
Although short. But at least I did not missed it


01:27:30.080 --> 01:27:34.596
I, Yan Fei-er
As the 16th monarch of Yan Guo 


01:27:35.040 --> 01:27:38.715
give the title of Zhao Yan warrior to Murong Shie-Hu


01:27:38.760 --> 01:27:42.275
From now on,Yan Guo will no more go into war


01:27:42.600 --> 01:27:46.070
and live peacefully with the nine nations


01:27:46.120 --> 01:27:50.955
Long Live the King! Long Live the King!


01:27:55.320 --> 01:27:56.992
Lanquan


01:27:57.240 --> 01:28:01.153
There will be no more war
that encroaches on every inch of this land


01:28:01.480 --> 01:28:09.034
Very quick , everywhere is our paradise!

